        <p>R Y LANDS' V. CATHOLIC Y.M.S.—Played at the Pavilion, Gcrsey-lane, on Tnealay. Scores : RYLANDS.. C.Y.M.S. ' Handicap 32 Handicap SO W Langley (capt) ...... ... 100 B J Kelly J Leah lOO M Cunningham 44 J Jeffery T lVarhurst G Thomas H Langley 55 P Cunningham E Blackledge lOO R Miller B4 J biuclair 675</p>
